'''From Santa''' was a [[Default Knife]] skin made by [[didi1147]]. It was designed and published on December 18, 2018, and was most likely meant to be released as part of the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. However, due to unknown circumstances, it was scrapped and never made it to the game.

==Trivia==
*The texture for the knife was made by [[didi1147]].<ref>https://www.roblox.com/library/2659488956/from-santa-knife</ref>
*It has a [[From Santa (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
